69712	69889	69697	69697	She	233	" This week Dr. Agathon Carver is holding a series of Inner Thought meetings there . A contrast indeed to this gay scene of worldly pleasure -- but then I have always lived on contrasts ! To me the only death is monotony . I always say to Ellen : Beware of monotony ; it 's the mother of all the deadly sins . But my poor child is going through a phase of exaltation , of abhorrence of the world . You know , I suppose , that she has declined all invitations to stay at Newport , even with her grandmother Mingott ? I could hardly persuade her to come with me to the Blenkers ' , if you will believe it ! The life she leads is morbid , unnatural . Ah , if she had only listened to me when it was still possible ... When the door was still open ... But shall we go down and watch this absorbing match ? I hear your May is one of the competitors . "
